WEBVTT

00:33.670 --> 00:36.280
[Mei Dong, Wanted Criminal]

00:35.240 --> 00:35.770
Mr. Zhou.

00:37.030 --> 00:37.520
Dong,

00:38.200 --> 00:39.200
how have you been?

00:39.790 --> 00:41.070
Things are good,

00:41.200 --> 00:42.200
all thanks to you.

00:42.330 --> 00:44.200
Is there something you need, Rong?

00:44.200 --> 00:45.230
Come on.

00:45.520 --> 00:46.110
As your buddy,

00:46.110 --> 00:47.710
I just called to check on you.

00:47.750 --> 00:49.410
Can't I show some care for you?

00:49.520 --> 00:50.580
Of course, you can.

00:51.280 --> 00:53.280
My Rong always looks out for his men.

00:53.960 --> 00:55.490
Alright, cut the nonsense.

00:56.110 --> 00:57.170
There's something

00:57.240 --> 00:58.430
I need your help with.

00:58.430 --> 00:59.520
Just say it, Rong.

00:59.880 --> 01:01.030
No matter what it is,

01:01.280 --> 01:02.610
I'll get it done for you.

01:03.390 --> 01:04.140
I've got

01:04.230 --> 01:05.950
300 million sitting idle right now.

01:05.950 --> 01:06.950
Help me transfer it from the country

01:06.950 --> 01:07.880
to your account.

01:09.430 --> 01:10.560
Rong, give me a second.

01:10.560 --> 01:10.950
I...

01:11.070 --> 01:12.070
Let go of me.

01:13.510 --> 01:14.039
Let's go.

01:20.510 --> 01:20.950
Rong,

01:21.950 --> 01:23.430
h-how much?

01:24.350 --> 01:25.080
300 million.

01:27.200 --> 01:28.000
Is it urgent?

01:29.120 --> 01:30.450
The sooner, the better.

01:33.120 --> 01:33.710
Rong,

01:34.950 --> 01:36.310
with an amount this big

01:37.070 --> 01:38.600
and you being in such a rush,

01:39.950 --> 01:41.820
the handling fee

01:42.150 --> 01:43.350
is gonna be a bit high.

01:44.110 --> 01:44.850
How much?

01:47.479 --> 01:48.560
Thirty percent.

01:48.789 --> 01:50.650
You're that desperate for money?

01:51.680 --> 01:52.640
Rong,

01:53.920 --> 01:55.620
if we're not in a hurry,

01:55.840 --> 01:58.150
I can transfer it
in small batches over time.

01:58.150 --> 02:00.480
I guarantee I can get it done
in half a year.

02:00.840 --> 02:02.610
I charge everyone else 15%,

02:04.040 --> 02:05.890
but for you, I'll do 10%.

02:06.200 --> 02:06.860
How's that?

02:07.400 --> 02:08.800
I'm okay with 10%.

02:09.000 --> 02:10.470
What about the half-year timeframe?

02:10.470 --> 02:11.730
Half a year is too long.

02:12.590 --> 02:14.370
I've got palms to grease

02:14.400 --> 02:15.630
at every level.

02:16.470 --> 02:17.750
I can't help it either.

02:19.240 --> 02:19.910
Dong,

02:20.360 --> 02:21.560
you think I, Zhou Rong,

02:21.560 --> 02:24.090
can't find anyone else
to launder money, huh?

02:24.680 --> 02:25.510
Rong,

02:26.120 --> 02:27.560
the scrutiny on domestic accounts

02:27.560 --> 02:29.030
right now is insane.

02:30.460 --> 02:31.850
If you don't trust me,

02:32.150 --> 02:33.910
you can ask around.

02:35.630 --> 02:36.490
But I guarantee

02:36.960 --> 02:38.250
nobody launders money

02:38.280 --> 02:39.829
faster or safer

02:39.250 --> 02:41.490
[Faster, Safer]

02:40.120 --> 02:41.079
than me.

04:05.420 --> 04:09.190
[Born with Luck]

04:09.260 --> 04:12.170
[Episode 13]

04:30.240 --> 04:30.750
Chief.

04:32.800 --> 04:33.310
Chief!

04:37.600 --> 04:39.500
Still nothing

04:39.800 --> 04:41.460
from Zhou Rong and Lang Bowen?

04:48.800 --> 04:49.420
Chief,

04:49.850 --> 04:50.790
how about this?

04:54.570 --> 04:56.630
We can't just keep waiting like this.

04:57.680 --> 04:59.270
We need to do something.

05:07.190 --> 05:07.720
Chief!

05:09.120 --> 05:09.980
I've got a clue.

05:17.190 --> 05:17.750
This is

05:17.750 --> 05:19.720
the surveillance footage of the kidnappers
that we found

05:19.720 --> 05:21.790
based on the clues
provided by Zheng Yongbing.

05:21.790 --> 05:24.310
[Hexiang Road]

05:24.740 --> 05:25.750
It's these two.

05:27.310 --> 05:28.880
Can't see their faces clearly though.

05:28.560 --> 05:32.690
[Hexiang Road]

05:32.240 --> 05:33.000
You can't see their faces,

05:33.000 --> 05:33.600
so how do you know

05:33.600 --> 05:34.430
it's these two?

05:34.430 --> 05:35.480
Why are we back on

05:35.510 --> 05:37.040
the provincial capital case again?

05:37.040 --> 05:38.380
Chief Zhang, I think...

05:38.600 --> 05:39.659
Take a look at this.

05:41.250 --> 05:44.260
[Sanjiangkou South Toll Gate]

05:41.310 --> 05:42.670
This is the footage

05:42.720 --> 05:43.510
from the highway entrance

05:43.510 --> 05:44.920
30 meters away, two minutes later.

05:44.920 --> 05:45.720
What's wrong?

05:46.430 --> 05:47.750
Why didn't these two suspects

05:47.750 --> 05:48.870
appear again

05:48.870 --> 05:49.800
on the roadside?

05:49.800 --> 05:50.720
[Sanjiangkou South]

05:54.750 --> 05:56.080
They got into a vehicle.

05:56.400 --> 05:57.430
That's their car.

05:59.310 --> 06:01.040
PingC·08915.

06:01.160 --> 06:02.120
Find this vehicle.

06:02.120 --> 06:02.480
Yes.

06:02.680 --> 06:03.480
Wait a minute!

06:06.310 --> 06:06.870
Chief Zhang,

06:06.870 --> 06:08.240
I've reported it
to the Provincial Department.

06:08.240 --> 06:08.950
The Criminal Investigation Corps
has ordered us

06:08.950 --> 06:10.360
to cooperate fully with
the provincial task force.

06:10.360 --> 06:11.600
They'll be here tomorrow.

06:11.600 --> 06:12.750
If they have any requests,

06:12.750 --> 06:14.350
we'll fully cooperate then.

06:15.310 --> 06:16.040
Right now, our full focus

06:16.040 --> 06:17.430
is to find these two people.

06:17.430 --> 06:18.030
Find them.

06:20.630 --> 06:21.480
What about

06:21.510 --> 06:22.510
our own case then?

06:23.480 --> 06:24.940
Borne on a favorable wind,

06:25.510 --> 06:27.380
I'll rise to the clouds.

06:42.580 --> 06:43.260
[Taxi]

06:42.720 --> 06:43.370
Look!

06:43.510 --> 06:44.640
I told you there was!

06:45.240 --> 06:45.970
What is that?

06:47.190 --> 06:48.220
It's so heavy.

06:48.920 --> 06:49.720
This is so cool.

06:49.720 --> 06:50.580
With this...

06:50.680 --> 06:51.810
The crowning touch, see?

06:50.840 --> 06:55.780
[Taxi]

07:03.720 --> 07:06.900
[Taxi]

07:04.250 --> 07:06.580
What the heck are you doing?
You scared me.

07:14.500 --> 07:16.030
Now we can take passengers.

07:26.240 --> 07:28.570
Dropping our own case to go play assistant

07:28.680 --> 07:30.000
for someone else?

07:32.190 --> 07:33.790
I'm going to see Chief Zhang.

07:33.870 --> 07:34.700
Captain Wang!

07:34.920 --> 07:35.880
Captain Wang.

07:36.240 --> 07:36.640
Speak.

07:38.240 --> 07:40.159
Do you know who's in charge of
the provincial capital explosion case?

07:40.159 --> 07:40.590
Who?

07:40.800 --> 07:41.400
Yan Liang.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.830
Captain of
the Provincial Criminal Investigation Corps.

07:43.830 --> 07:44.630
I don't care who he is!

07:44.630 --> 07:45.870
We should handle our own cases!

07:45.870 --> 07:46.720
Captain Wang,

07:47.270 --> 07:49.480
how do you still not understand
the Chief's intentions?

07:49.480 --> 07:50.240
Yan Liang

07:50.430 --> 07:53.310
is a well-known criminal psychology expert
in the province.

07:53.310 --> 07:54.800
He once deduced a suspect's escape plan

07:54.800 --> 07:56.860
from nothing but their handwriting.

07:56.920 --> 07:58.320
He's a legendary figure.

07:59.000 --> 07:59.860
Think about it—

08:00.390 --> 08:02.320
if we cooperate with him this time,

08:02.360 --> 08:03.480
it's only reasonable

08:03.480 --> 08:05.720
that he supports us with something, right?

08:05.720 --> 08:07.360
No matter how cunning
Zhou Rong and Lang Bowen are,

08:07.360 --> 08:08.960
can they really be his match?

08:10.680 --> 08:12.680
Yan Liang and his team
will arrive tomorrow.

08:12.680 --> 08:14.140
All the more reason not to!

08:15.160 --> 08:16.190
Come on, everyone!

08:16.190 --> 08:17.790
Drop whatever you're doing!

08:24.000 --> 08:24.730
Chief Zhang,

08:25.160 --> 08:25.820
look.

08:26.750 --> 08:28.390
Not just the criminal investigation unit,

08:28.390 --> 08:29.390
but everyone in the station

08:29.390 --> 08:30.730
who's free

08:30.830 --> 08:32.289
has been pulled in to help.

08:32.390 --> 08:33.850
At this rate of screening,

08:34.360 --> 08:35.200
that Xiali car—

08:35.200 --> 08:36.120
I'll tell you straight—

08:36.120 --> 08:38.120
won't escape even if it grows wings!

08:38.600 --> 08:39.570
Is this really appropriate?

08:39.570 --> 08:40.480
Will it hold everyone up...

08:40.480 --> 08:42.210
As long as we can solve the case.

08:42.960 --> 08:43.440
Chief,

08:43.840 --> 08:44.370
found it.

08:47.330 --> 08:49.550
This was captured
on the early morning of the 3rd.

08:49.550 --> 08:52.000
[Ping'an West Road, Sanjiangkou,
Ping'an Province]

08:59.440 --> 09:00.050
Okay.

09:00.070 --> 09:01.390
Find these two cars!

09:20.730 --> 09:21.830
[Zhou Rong]

09:26.840 --> 09:28.030
Hello, who is it?

09:28.510 --> 09:29.260
It's me.

09:29.730 --> 09:30.450
Mr. Zhou.

09:30.920 --> 09:31.720
Anything up?

09:32.120 --> 09:33.450
Alright, do it your way.

09:33.750 --> 09:35.080
So what's the next step?

09:36.270 --> 09:37.770
Mr. Zhou, next,

09:37.800 --> 09:38.980
we can do this.

09:39.270 --> 09:40.960
I'll find a safe place,

09:41.030 --> 09:42.270
register a company,

09:42.600 --> 09:43.840
and then hire a lawyer

09:43.840 --> 09:45.900
to contact your company officially.

09:49.200 --> 09:50.290
The last image of that car

09:50.290 --> 09:51.630
was captured on this road.

09:51.630 --> 09:53.480
But the suburban cameras are sparse,

09:53.480 --> 09:55.940
so it's hard to pinpoint
its exact location.

09:59.750 --> 10:01.090
Buddy, need a cab?

10:01.150 --> 10:01.720
Need a cab?

10:01.720 --> 10:02.320
No.

10:02.870 --> 10:03.890
We just started our business.

10:03.890 --> 10:05.320
Yeah, we can give you a discount.

10:05.320 --> 10:06.720
Not even with a discount.

10:07.110 --> 10:07.910
Hold on.

10:09.580 --> 10:10.710
Where are you going?

10:16.540 --> 10:17.520
Nowhere. Go.

10:19.790 --> 10:21.990
-Nut. Seriously.
-What does that mean?

10:22.270 --> 10:23.060
This guy...

10:39.830 --> 10:41.400
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

10:42.790 --> 10:43.960
Song Xing is still looking for the car,

10:43.960 --> 10:45.420
but there isn't much hope.

10:47.310 --> 10:49.360
Yan Liang and his team are almost here.

10:49.360 --> 10:50.890
We've found the Land Rover!

10:51.570 --> 10:52.100
Found it?

10:52.120 --> 10:52.690
Yes.

10:56.940 --> 10:57.870
How many kidnappers are in the car?

10:57.870 --> 10:58.770
Both of them.

10:58.840 --> 10:59.650
Where are they now?

10:59.650 --> 11:01.450
Senbo Expressway Toll Station.

11:01.480 --> 11:02.790
That means they've left Sanjiangkou.

11:02.790 --> 11:04.050
They've left the city.

11:04.720 --> 11:05.660
Chase them immediately.

11:05.660 --> 11:06.750
Tell the canteen to prepare lunch!

11:06.750 --> 11:07.840
Yan Liang and the others are almost here!

11:07.840 --> 11:09.320
We have to give the Provincial Department
a big gift!

11:09.320 --> 11:10.780
Chief Zhang! Chief Zhang!

11:14.630 --> 11:16.090
That video you just saw...

11:17.120 --> 11:18.450
was from three days ago.

11:19.080 --> 11:20.120
Why didn't you say so earlier?

11:20.120 --> 11:20.980
You didn't ask.

11:23.750 --> 11:25.120
Should we still pursue them?

11:25.120 --> 11:25.850
Pursue what?

11:26.960 --> 11:28.000
Never mind leaving the city—

11:28.000 --> 11:30.530
they've probably left
the province already.

11:30.550 --> 11:31.240
Chief,

11:31.390 --> 11:33.390
we found the owner of the Land Rover!

11:37.010 --> 11:38.060
The owner is Yang Wei,

11:37.650 --> 11:40.040
[Basic information; Name: Yang Wei]

11:38.160 --> 11:39.410
an ex-convict

11:39.960 --> 11:41.630
who's now living off loan sharking.

11:40.100 --> 11:41.870
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau
Personal Information Form]

11:41.790 --> 11:42.640
The car is his.

11:42.870 --> 11:43.390
Good.

11:44.270 --> 11:44.980
Finding the owner

11:44.980 --> 11:46.150
at least gives us something.

11:46.150 --> 11:47.360
See if you can track down Yang Wei.

11:47.360 --> 11:48.760
What did he go to jail for?

11:49.960 --> 11:51.810
He got into a fight

11:51.840 --> 11:52.910
defending his friend Lin Kai

11:52.910 --> 11:53.870
and left the other man

11:53.870 --> 11:55.080
with a second-degree disability.

11:55.080 --> 11:56.490
That's what got him sent in.

11:56.490 --> 11:58.220
[Gender: Male]

12:30.240 --> 12:30.970
Is he at home?

12:32.310 --> 12:33.910
If he were, would I let you in?

12:35.610 --> 12:37.270
How many days has he been gone?

12:37.320 --> 12:38.230
A few days.

12:41.670 --> 12:42.240
Are you here for me,

12:42.240 --> 12:43.030
or for him?

12:45.200 --> 12:45.730
No, no.

12:46.150 --> 12:47.080
Sister-in-law.

12:48.360 --> 12:50.620
You're calling me "sister-in-law" now?

12:57.840 --> 12:59.000
I really have something important.

12:59.000 --> 13:00.930
Half an hour wouldn't hurt, right?

13:07.150 --> 13:08.480
Are you coming in or not?

13:44.790 --> 13:45.470
What are you doing?

13:45.470 --> 13:46.670
Lin Kai isn't at home.

13:47.240 --> 13:47.800
Where...

13:48.050 --> 13:48.970
Where did he go?

13:50.080 --> 13:51.080
How would I know?

14:00.560 --> 14:01.490
Sister-in-law,

14:01.590 --> 14:03.360
can you let me in to talk?

14:03.840 --> 14:04.480
Oh, my.

14:04.500 --> 14:05.510
A man and a woman alone—

14:05.510 --> 14:07.170
how can you even suggest that?

14:19.480 --> 14:20.120
Come out.

14:22.590 --> 14:23.720
Looking for Lin Kai?

14:24.030 --> 14:25.630
Can you stop bringing him up?

14:28.170 --> 14:30.050
I haven't been able to reach him for days.

14:30.050 --> 14:32.780
I'm really worried
something's happened to him.

14:36.650 --> 14:37.630
If others see me like this,

14:37.630 --> 14:39.490
it would be really embarrassing.

14:43.060 --> 14:44.990
What could possibly happen to him?

14:45.200 --> 14:46.030
He's probably off somewhere,

14:46.030 --> 14:47.830
fooling around with some woman.

14:52.110 --> 14:53.800
I have a bad feeling about this.

14:53.800 --> 14:55.260
I need to find him quickly.

14:55.600 --> 14:57.060
Are you still coming over?

14:58.630 --> 15:00.630
Don't be like this, Sister-in-law.

15:00.790 --> 15:02.590
Kai and I are like real brothers.

15:04.310 --> 15:04.830
I know.

15:14.760 --> 15:16.680
[Precise Phone Location]

15:18.390 --> 15:20.020
Isn't this illegal?

15:20.150 --> 15:21.190
Obviously.

15:24.790 --> 15:26.390
You can really track a phone?

15:28.000 --> 15:29.000
What do you think?

15:31.280 --> 15:32.660
Then help me track one.

15:35.750 --> 15:37.610
Tell me your wife's phone number.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.040
It's not my wife.

15:39.910 --> 15:41.550
Just say your wife's number!

15:48.120 --> 15:48.720
Excuse me.

16:04.200 --> 16:04.650
Hello?

16:05.150 --> 16:05.790
Is this Yang Wei?

16:05.790 --> 16:06.200
Yes.

16:06.630 --> 16:08.240
This is
the Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau.

16:08.240 --> 16:10.300
We'd like to ask you about something.

16:11.630 --> 16:12.670
The license plate's been changed

16:12.670 --> 16:14.120
and the car's paint altered.

16:14.120 --> 16:15.380
We've come back again.

16:15.480 --> 16:17.540
Zhou Rong can still slip away from us?

16:20.400 --> 16:22.200
Can he shake us?

16:26.870 --> 16:28.970
He's a rat in a trap!

16:34.190 --> 16:36.190
Hold it in. Don't throw up in the car.

16:38.160 --> 16:38.980
We're almost at the service area.

16:38.980 --> 16:39.800
Hang in there.

16:42.650 --> 16:45.250
[Sandu Service Area]

16:53.360 --> 16:53.870
Water.

16:59.150 --> 17:00.210
-You okay?
-Water.

17:01.320 --> 17:02.380
We're out of water.

17:02.720 --> 17:05.380
Here, have a steamed bun
to settle your stomach.

17:09.589 --> 17:10.000
Here.

17:11.310 --> 17:13.440
Can't you at least buy me a bottle of...

17:16.750 --> 17:17.550
What's wrong?

17:18.240 --> 17:18.960
This isn't the one we bought for that jerk

17:18.960 --> 17:19.920
that day, is it?

17:20.720 --> 17:21.720
When did we buy it?

17:22.030 --> 17:22.690
Yesterday.

17:23.880 --> 17:24.790
Didn't give it to him?

17:24.790 --> 17:25.480
I forgot.

17:26.720 --> 17:27.920
So you haven't checked on him
these past few days,

17:27.920 --> 17:29.780
and he hasn't made a sound either?

18:12.070 --> 18:13.400
Whose phone is ringing?

18:13.750 --> 18:14.400
His.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.240
Find somewhere out of the way

18:21.240 --> 18:21.970
and bury him.

18:29.470 --> 18:30.180
[Calling]

18:34.550 --> 18:35.440
The line is busy.

18:35.440 --> 18:37.040
The phone must be turned off.

18:37.480 --> 18:39.010
Can you still track it then?

18:39.350 --> 18:40.550
I'm a professional.

18:44.360 --> 18:47.500
[September 6, 2012]

18:48.070 --> 18:49.530
The owner of the Land Rover

18:50.000 --> 18:51.200
is this guy, Yang Wei.

18:51.750 --> 18:53.400
By comparing surveillance footage,
we've confirmed

18:53.400 --> 18:55.200
the kidnapped person is Lin Kai.

18:55.960 --> 18:57.090
They're very close—

18:57.480 --> 18:58.410
sworn brothers.

18:58.680 --> 18:59.610
Sworn brothers?

19:00.030 --> 19:00.790
And Liu Bei.

19:01.510 --> 19:02.840
And there's another...

19:03.510 --> 19:05.110
They also have a big brother
named Mei Dong,

19:05.110 --> 19:06.160
who is also a wanted criminal

19:06.160 --> 19:07.760
and has been fleeing abroad.

19:07.790 --> 19:08.980
What a den of crooks.

19:09.070 --> 19:10.600
Quite the crew they've got.

19:11.350 --> 19:12.560
As for

19:12.640 --> 19:14.700
why Lin Kai was driving Yang Wei's car

19:15.160 --> 19:17.160
and why the kidnappers took Lin Kai,

19:18.160 --> 19:20.070
we can only get answers from Yang Wei.

19:20.070 --> 19:20.930
Look at him.

19:22.240 --> 19:23.840
He's clearly a regular here.

19:24.590 --> 19:26.850
Doesn't look like the cooperative type.

19:27.750 --> 19:29.480
So, how should we question him?

19:41.020 --> 19:41.480
Officers,

19:41.480 --> 19:42.510
I really don't know anything.

19:42.510 --> 19:43.710
It's no use asking me.

19:44.160 --> 19:44.960
Lin Kai was kidnapped.

19:44.960 --> 19:45.960
Did you know that?

19:48.830 --> 19:50.480
That's still got nothing to do with me.

19:50.480 --> 19:51.740
Nothing to do with you?

19:52.480 --> 19:53.590
As far as we know,

19:55.000 --> 19:55.960
there is a little conflict

19:55.960 --> 19:57.240
between you

19:57.510 --> 19:58.880
and your sworn brother.

20:03.200 --> 20:04.060
What conflict?

20:41.270 --> 20:41.800
Sit down.

20:44.480 --> 20:45.810
Sworn brothers,

20:45.880 --> 20:47.810
yet you could do such a thing to him.

20:48.510 --> 20:49.240
Did you think

20:49.270 --> 20:50.880
you were being careful enough

20:50.880 --> 20:53.080
that you wouldn't get caught on camera?

20:53.160 --> 20:54.350
Impossible. Well...

20:54.350 --> 20:55.510
Is the video ready?

21:17.850 --> 21:19.580
Do you want us to play it for you?

21:26.750 --> 21:27.240
Play it.

21:32.080 --> 21:33.740
Are we really going to play it?

22:21.260 --> 22:21.740
Okay.

22:21.770 --> 22:22.790
Then let's

22:22.830 --> 22:23.890
enjoy it together.

22:25.120 --> 22:26.320
I've slept with Ying.

22:29.920 --> 22:31.320
State the relationship.

22:31.640 --> 22:32.840
She's Lin Kai's wife.

22:34.600 --> 22:35.770
Except for this, e-e-everything...

22:35.770 --> 22:37.480
everything between us
has been aboveboard. W-We...

22:37.480 --> 22:38.240
We have no conflict.

22:38.240 --> 22:39.300
"Except for this?"

22:39.640 --> 22:40.840
Is that not a big deal?

22:41.270 --> 22:41.880
Officer.

22:43.920 --> 22:45.110
Lin Kai is away all year round. He...

22:45.110 --> 22:46.510
H-He just hires hookers.

22:46.750 --> 22:47.310
For more than a year,

22:47.310 --> 22:48.640
he barely touches Ying.

22:48.830 --> 22:49.790
Well, Ying and I... I...

22:49.790 --> 22:50.510
We are...

22:51.160 --> 22:52.070
We are truly...

22:53.240 --> 22:54.030
Sometimes we'd even...

22:54.030 --> 22:55.410
cover his photo on the wall.

22:55.410 --> 22:56.940
He couldn't possibly know!

22:57.610 --> 22:58.680
And i-it's even more impossible
for me to...

22:58.680 --> 23:00.080
W-Why would I kidnap him?

23:00.310 --> 23:01.460
I'm innocent, officer!

23:01.460 --> 23:03.260
Whether you are innocent or not,

23:03.400 --> 23:05.260
we will investigate thoroughly.

23:05.790 --> 23:06.820
But first,

23:06.920 --> 23:08.180
you need to cooperate.

23:08.240 --> 23:09.170
I'll cooperate.

23:09.720 --> 23:10.780
I definitely will.

23:15.880 --> 23:17.160
[Subject: Yang Wei]

23:21.550 --> 23:23.170
I-I-I can go now?

23:23.480 --> 23:25.080
Don't leave the city for now.

23:25.110 --> 23:26.840
Be available whenever we call.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.000
I'm going now.

23:32.430 --> 23:33.110
Don't go yet.

23:33.110 --> 23:34.040
Wait over there.

23:34.720 --> 23:36.050
Stand outside and wait!

23:41.270 --> 23:43.000
Customs just flagged someone—

23:43.000 --> 23:44.060
possibly Mei Dong.

23:45.330 --> 23:46.790
Come on, Yang Wei. Come in.

23:47.770 --> 23:48.390
Come in.

23:49.410 --> 23:50.810
-You...
-You...

23:51.720 --> 23:54.110
The affair
between you and your sister-in-law...

23:54.110 --> 23:55.440
Go home and sort that out.

23:55.440 --> 23:56.570
Handle it properly.

23:57.920 --> 23:58.310
Go.

24:03.590 --> 24:06.250
Aren't you going to question him
about Mei Dong?

24:06.330 --> 24:07.010
Chief,

24:07.590 --> 24:08.880
should we have Customs

24:08.900 --> 24:10.170
detain that person

24:10.350 --> 24:11.720
and verify his identity?

24:11.720 --> 24:12.310
No.

24:14.160 --> 24:15.070
Just let him in.

24:15.350 --> 24:16.950
What if it really is Mei Dong?

24:17.350 --> 24:17.750
If he dares

24:17.750 --> 24:19.030
to take such a huge risk to come back,

24:19.030 --> 24:19.720
he might be related

24:19.720 --> 24:20.450
to this case.

24:21.240 --> 24:22.400
Whether there's a big fish or not,

24:22.400 --> 24:23.860
let's cast the line first.

24:24.200 --> 24:25.580
Now it seems

24:25.750 --> 24:26.720
Lin Kai and the kidnappers

24:26.720 --> 24:28.240
only had a traffic dispute.

24:28.240 --> 24:28.920
The kidnappers

24:28.920 --> 24:30.110
wanted Lin Kai's car,

24:30.110 --> 24:31.370
so they kidnapped him.

24:33.330 --> 24:35.350
[Phone Location Results]
[Location: Sandu Expressway Service Area]

24:39.640 --> 24:40.760
Why would he be

24:40.790 --> 24:43.270
at the Sandu Expressway Service Area?

24:43.400 --> 24:44.440
According to this,

24:44.440 --> 24:46.840
he's at the Sandu Expressway Service Area.

24:47.000 --> 24:47.480
[Phone Location Results]
[Location: Sandu Expressway Service Area]

24:50.030 --> 24:50.880
Thank you.

24:52.200 --> 24:52.650
Well...

24:52.650 --> 24:53.400
Hold on!

24:53.880 --> 24:54.680
Pay up!

24:55.550 --> 24:56.180
How much?

24:57.500 --> 24:57.700
[Precise Phone Tracking: 200 per search]

25:09.350 --> 25:10.150
Two thousand.

25:13.120 --> 25:14.250
Money to burn.

25:17.180 --> 25:18.410
[Precise Phone Tracking: 200 per search]

25:18.440 --> 25:19.270
[Charge only after locating the target]

25:19.270 --> 25:19.950
[200]

25:37.960 --> 25:38.480
Chao,

25:40.030 --> 25:41.760
I swear I didn't kill that jerk.

25:42.310 --> 25:42.700
You even told me

25:42.700 --> 25:43.810
not to kill him.

25:44.350 --> 25:45.690
Every time we stopped,

25:45.830 --> 25:47.270
I even let him go to the bathroom

25:47.270 --> 25:48.330
and gave him food.

25:48.590 --> 25:50.120
I was very attentive to him.

25:50.200 --> 25:50.880
I've never been

25:50.880 --> 25:52.480
that attentive to my own dad.

25:52.640 --> 25:53.180
Chao.

26:10.530 --> 26:12.660
The cuckold choked to death on his own.

26:13.720 --> 26:15.300
So he choked to death.

26:15.550 --> 26:17.020
Then it's not on us, right?

26:17.070 --> 26:18.070
You wish.

26:22.640 --> 26:23.700
Come give me a hand.

26:32.000 --> 26:33.690
He got carsick just like you.

26:34.750 --> 26:37.110
But with a towel stuffed in his mouth,
he couldn't throw up.

26:37.110 --> 26:37.750
Everything in his stomach

26:37.750 --> 26:39.280
surged up through his nose—

26:40.030 --> 26:40.960
he suffocated.

26:45.960 --> 26:46.680
This death is on our hands,

26:46.680 --> 26:48.210
no matter how you look at it.

26:52.200 --> 26:52.870
I was planning to

26:52.870 --> 26:54.600
let him go once the job was done.

26:55.790 --> 26:57.400
After all, we've never
killed anyone before.

26:57.400 --> 26:58.800
If we got caught someday,

26:58.830 --> 27:00.630
the worst we'd done was robbery—

27:00.680 --> 27:01.880
not a death sentence.

27:05.880 --> 27:07.270
But once we have blood on our hands,

27:07.270 --> 27:08.470
everything changes.

27:10.110 --> 27:11.310
Then what do we do now?

27:19.880 --> 27:20.680
Bury him.

27:22.220 --> 27:22.790
Where...

27:23.110 --> 27:24.510
Where should we bury him?

27:25.000 --> 27:27.220
This place may not be exactly scenic,

27:27.640 --> 27:28.700
but it's spacious.

27:29.310 --> 27:31.110
Land prices being what they are,

27:31.310 --> 27:32.350
and the location so convenient—

27:32.350 --> 27:33.750
easy access to anywhere.

27:35.110 --> 27:36.440
We've done right by him.

27:56.310 --> 27:58.040
Chao, aren't you going to help?

27:58.840 --> 27:59.770
I'll keep watch.

28:03.880 --> 28:06.400
[Shengshun Taxi]

28:06.490 --> 28:07.360
Where to?

28:07.390 --> 28:08.860
Sandu Expressway Service Area, going?

28:08.860 --> 28:10.000
No, it's too late!

28:08.890 --> 28:15.960
[Shengshun Taxi]

28:10.160 --> 28:10.570
No!

28:10.680 --> 28:11.880
It's not late, not late at all!

28:11.880 --> 28:12.790
I'm not going that way.

28:12.790 --> 28:13.590
I'm off shift!

28:13.680 --> 28:14.350
It's too late.

28:14.350 --> 28:15.480
It's not too late...

28:17.720 --> 28:18.470
Driver,

28:18.680 --> 28:19.910
Sandu Service Area, going?

28:19.910 --> 28:21.240
It's too far. Not going.

28:23.670 --> 28:31.060
[Vacant]

28:25.590 --> 28:27.050
Why is no one hailing a cab?

28:27.680 --> 28:28.890
You call this a cab?

28:29.200 --> 28:30.930
It's literally like a tractor.

28:32.960 --> 28:40.200
[Vacant]

28:33.070 --> 28:33.840
That guy's hailing.

28:33.840 --> 28:35.500
That guy's flagging one down.

28:43.070 --> 28:44.090
Sir, need a ride?

28:45.010 --> 28:45.940
Licensed taxi.

28:46.690 --> 28:47.960
[Vacant]

28:47.350 --> 28:48.110
Metered fare.

28:48.110 --> 28:48.690
Right.

28:49.000 --> 28:51.400
Out in the suburbs,
we always go two to a cab.

28:55.510 --> 28:56.480
You're still willing to

28:56.480 --> 28:57.920
head to the suburbs this late?

28:57.920 --> 28:58.250
Yeah.

28:58.260 --> 28:59.260
Exactly. It's...

28:59.260 --> 29:00.550
It's late, so there are two of us.

29:00.550 --> 29:01.650
Safer this way.

29:02.720 --> 29:03.850
Where are you going?

29:05.960 --> 29:07.090
Sandu Service Area.

29:07.120 --> 29:07.840
Perfect!

29:07.870 --> 29:09.120
Perfect. Hop in.

29:09.200 --> 29:09.640
I'm telling you,

29:09.640 --> 29:11.200
you're lucky you ran into us.

29:11.200 --> 29:11.960
Otherwise...

29:11.960 --> 29:13.790
There aren't many cabs on this road.

29:13.790 --> 29:14.680
You could be waiting till tomorrow morning

29:14.680 --> 29:15.720
and still not get a ride.

29:15.720 --> 29:16.660
Exactly.

29:16.960 --> 29:17.480
Get in.

29:25.400 --> 29:25.880
Okay.

29:26.030 --> 29:26.560
Let's go.

29:51.030 --> 29:51.590
You done?

29:51.960 --> 29:52.440
Yeah.

30:02.590 --> 30:03.590
Where's the body?

30:03.710 --> 30:04.520
Right here.

30:15.550 --> 30:17.480
You really treat him like your dad?

30:18.110 --> 30:19.480
Hey, I worked hard on this.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.200
Don't just come here

30:20.200 --> 30:21.360
and mock me.

30:21.790 --> 30:22.550
No, I...

30:22.830 --> 30:24.030
I told you to dig a hole and bury him,

30:24.030 --> 30:25.200
but why did you build a grave

30:25.200 --> 30:26.940
right in the middle of the road?

30:27.110 --> 30:28.590
Chao, you can't blame me for this.

30:28.590 --> 30:29.640
I barely dug a few times,

30:29.640 --> 30:30.440
and it was all rock underneath.

30:30.440 --> 30:31.480
I shoveled... Well...

30:31.480 --> 30:32.960
How big was the rock?

30:34.330 --> 30:35.440
The entire city underground

30:35.440 --> 30:36.270
is solid rock.

30:37.230 --> 30:37.920
Well...

30:39.590 --> 30:41.160
Well, I just want to ask you—

30:41.180 --> 30:42.160
since it's all rock down there,

30:42.160 --> 30:43.820
where did this soil come from?

30:44.200 --> 30:45.790
I dug a hole over there

30:45.880 --> 30:47.030
and shoveled the soil over here

30:47.030 --> 30:47.610
one scoop at a time.

30:47.610 --> 30:48.940
I went back and forth...

30:49.830 --> 30:51.400
You knew enough to dig a hole over there

30:51.400 --> 30:53.720
and move the dirt here to bury the guy,

30:53.960 --> 30:54.960
but it didn't occur to you

30:54.960 --> 30:56.490
to just bury the body there?

31:00.840 --> 31:01.920
Dig the body up.

31:02.120 --> 31:02.890
Well, Chao!

31:03.480 --> 31:04.680
I just made his grave,

31:04.680 --> 31:06.420
and now y-you want to move it?

31:07.510 --> 31:08.110
Well, Chao,

31:08.110 --> 31:10.030
I can't bring myself to dig up graves!

31:10.030 --> 31:10.940
Shut up!

31:11.830 --> 31:13.290
I don't trust you anymore!

31:13.920 --> 31:14.930
You go keep watch.

31:18.510 --> 31:19.200
Well, Chao.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.010
Let me do it!

31:22.400 --> 31:23.240
Let me do it!

31:24.030 --> 31:24.920
Chao, let me do it!

31:24.920 --> 31:25.450
Get lost!

31:50.190 --> 31:50.780
Chao,

31:51.180 --> 31:52.580
you really are the pro here.

31:52.580 --> 31:54.150
It can fit another body.

31:54.270 --> 31:56.000
Why don't you lie in there then?

31:57.270 --> 31:57.880
Bury him.

32:00.710 --> 32:02.110
You won't move the grave,

32:02.590 --> 32:04.850
but you can't even fill the pit properly?

32:29.880 --> 32:30.610
Is this okay?

32:30.830 --> 32:31.470
Let's go.

32:31.510 --> 32:32.310
Wait a minute.

32:38.240 --> 32:42.550
[Cables Below; Do Not Dig]

32:48.090 --> 32:51.680
[Cables Below; Do Not Dig]

32:52.150 --> 32:53.080
Is it okay, Chao?

32:53.310 --> 32:53.920
Classic

32:53.960 --> 32:56.490
"no silver buried here," huh?
Really subtle.

32:56.720 --> 32:57.920
I'll put it back then.

32:59.400 --> 33:00.060
It's fine.

33:00.110 --> 33:01.350
Let's just leave it at that.

33:01.350 --> 33:02.680
Where are we going next?

33:02.720 --> 33:03.650
Back to the city.

33:04.000 --> 33:06.140
We need to hurry up with this job.

33:41.050 --> 33:41.700
In a bit,

33:42.410 --> 33:43.470
I'll pull over.

33:44.640 --> 33:45.720
You grab the hammer

33:46.270 --> 33:48.110
and go to the back
to get the money from that dude.

33:48.110 --> 33:50.370
If he won't hand it over,
cave his head in.

33:51.300 --> 33:52.230
Why don't you go?

33:52.310 --> 33:53.880
I'm driving, aren't I?

33:55.680 --> 33:56.570
You started this mess.

33:56.570 --> 33:57.160
You go.

34:02.130 --> 34:03.400
It's just killing someone.

34:03.400 --> 34:04.010
You do it.

34:04.440 --> 34:05.110
You got it.

34:05.960 --> 34:07.240
"Just killing someone?"

34:07.240 --> 34:07.920
You make it sound

34:07.920 --> 34:09.190
like buying groceries.

34:09.190 --> 34:09.790
You go.

34:10.110 --> 34:11.650
Tinggang, you go.

34:11.670 --> 34:12.360
You go.

34:12.840 --> 34:13.620
You take it.

34:13.650 --> 34:14.860
You go. You...

34:19.320 --> 34:19.760
I just...

34:19.760 --> 34:20.110
Crap...

34:20.110 --> 34:20.770
He ran away.

34:35.800 --> 34:36.710
My fault now?

34:39.230 --> 34:40.760
I didn't even say anything.

34:41.280 --> 34:43.010
You were saying it in your head.

34:44.320 --> 34:45.780
I wasn't even thinking it.

34:47.960 --> 34:48.940
Well then, d-d-do

34:48.940 --> 34:49.820
we chase him?

34:50.050 --> 34:51.580
Chase what? We're exposed.

34:52.000 --> 34:52.600
Let's go.

35:02.710 --> 35:04.740
[Cables Below; Do Not Dig]

35:32.000 --> 35:33.060
Take the body away.

35:38.150 --> 35:38.950
-Chen.
-Chen.

35:40.440 --> 35:41.640
Chief, Captain Wang.

35:41.840 --> 35:42.900
Who reported this?

35:43.070 --> 35:44.470
It was an anonymous call.

35:44.590 --> 35:45.390
We traced it.

35:45.670 --> 35:47.000
It was from a public phone booth.

35:47.000 --> 35:48.000
An anonymous tip?

35:48.400 --> 35:49.920
Have we verified the victim's identity?

35:49.920 --> 35:51.030
The victim is Lin Kai.

35:51.030 --> 35:51.710
Time of death

35:51.710 --> 35:53.050
was over 48 hours ago.

35:54.230 --> 35:55.360
So did the kidnappers

35:55.360 --> 35:56.420
kill him

35:56.480 --> 35:57.480
before leaving Sanjiangkou,

35:57.480 --> 35:59.140
or did they come back and do it?

35:59.320 --> 36:00.580
We've been monitoring

36:00.920 --> 36:02.180
all the highway exits.

36:02.400 --> 36:03.860
No sign of them returning.

36:03.960 --> 36:04.960
Let's wait for Chen's

36:04.960 --> 36:05.800
autopsy results.

36:05.800 --> 36:06.860
If the time of death

36:07.000 --> 36:08.140
is over 72 hours ago,

36:08.280 --> 36:09.070
it means

36:09.110 --> 36:10.770
they killed him before leaving.

36:10.770 --> 36:11.590
If the time of death

36:11.590 --> 36:12.930
is within 72 hours,

36:13.000 --> 36:14.030
they must have come back

36:14.030 --> 36:15.080
and likely switched vehicles.

36:15.080 --> 36:22.710
[Police]

36:16.630 --> 36:17.030
Chief.

36:17.360 --> 36:18.160
Captain Wang.

36:18.440 --> 36:19.150
We can basically rule out

36:19.150 --> 36:20.280
robbery as a motive.

36:20.360 --> 36:22.310
The phone and wallet are both on the body,

36:22.310 --> 36:24.770
and there's still a lot of cash
in the wallet.

36:25.770 --> 36:27.380
[Jinshuiting]

36:30.130 --> 36:31.190
What does this say?

36:33.560 --> 36:37.570
[Jinshuiting]

36:33.860 --> 36:35.400
This is the suspect's backpack.

36:35.400 --> 36:36.920
There are only a few clothes inside.

36:36.920 --> 36:38.320
It's written in cursive.

36:38.760 --> 36:39.590
Hegegao.

36:39.760 --> 36:40.560
Jinshuiting.

36:40.580 --> 36:42.710
It should be pronounced Jinshuiting.

36:43.130 --> 36:44.660
[Jinshuiting]

36:48.400 --> 36:49.230
Hegegao.

36:49.520 --> 36:53.950
[Police]

36:50.880 --> 36:51.440
Hegegao.

36:51.550 --> 36:52.220
What?

36:52.920 --> 36:54.130
It's "Jinshuiting."

36:55.950 --> 36:58.410
Same as the character
on Liu Bei's backpack.

37:00.570 --> 37:01.500
Summon Yang Wei.

37:03.390 --> 37:06.950
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau
Personal Information Form]

37:12.070 --> 37:13.670
Li Feng has confessed it all.

37:14.090 --> 37:15.890
He is a Class-A wanted criminal.

37:16.080 --> 37:16.710
This time,

37:16.710 --> 37:18.280
you finally caught him.

37:47.480 --> 37:48.740
Lin Kai is really gone?

38:06.560 --> 38:08.290
Can you still hold it together?

38:14.000 --> 38:15.760
We called you in today

38:15.780 --> 38:17.310
to talk about Jinshuiting.

38:18.720 --> 38:20.170
How much do you know

38:20.360 --> 38:21.290
about this gang?

38:24.190 --> 38:25.300
Jinshuiting...

38:26.360 --> 38:27.150
was, you could say,

38:27.150 --> 38:28.350
our first pot of gold.

38:29.360 --> 38:30.390
At that time, our big brother,

38:30.390 --> 38:32.190
Mei Dong, handled the channels.

38:32.630 --> 38:34.160
Liu Bei managed the supply.

38:36.030 --> 38:37.760
Well, Liu Bei robbed the tombs,

38:37.800 --> 38:39.660
and Dong fenced the stolen items.

38:40.030 --> 38:41.040
Lin Kai and I

38:41.070 --> 38:42.600
handled market expansion.

38:44.070 --> 38:44.600
Later on,

38:44.630 --> 38:46.030
the business got better.

38:46.280 --> 38:47.630
We all had money.

38:48.760 --> 38:49.920
The first time I ever had abalone

38:49.920 --> 38:50.900
was at that...

38:53.220 --> 38:55.220
The company was started by Mei Dong?

38:57.840 --> 38:58.700
And after that?

39:01.710 --> 39:02.570
And after that,

39:02.630 --> 39:03.440
Jinshuiting's business

39:03.440 --> 39:04.500
just kept growing.

39:04.630 --> 39:05.250
Then...

39:05.550 --> 39:07.880
D-Dong and Liu Bei started thinking about

39:07.880 --> 39:08.610
how to take the business

39:08.610 --> 39:09.610
to the next level.

39:10.230 --> 39:11.760
Then they decided to

39:11.880 --> 39:13.310
crowdfund—

39:13.590 --> 39:15.320
to rob
the Mausoleum of the First Qin Emperor.

39:15.320 --> 39:16.120
I heard.

39:16.880 --> 39:18.770
You guys really dared to dream big.

39:18.770 --> 39:19.510
If you were in Egypt,

39:19.510 --> 39:21.110
would you have gone to
dig up the pyramids?

39:21.110 --> 39:22.170
We surveyed it.

39:23.150 --> 39:24.410
The pyramids in Egypt,

39:24.670 --> 39:26.150
the ancient city of Pompeii in Italy,

39:26.150 --> 39:28.080
and the Mayan temples in Honduras—

39:28.280 --> 39:29.740
Dong checked them all out.

39:30.400 --> 39:31.110
That's why they say

39:31.110 --> 39:32.880
you need to get out and see the world.

39:32.880 --> 39:33.840
The more places you see,

39:33.840 --> 39:36.000
the more you realize
how good things are back home.

39:36.000 --> 39:36.800
Those places—

39:36.880 --> 39:38.550
t-there's nothing left underground.

39:38.550 --> 39:39.550
It's still our country
that has the good stuff.

39:39.550 --> 39:42.110
-So much treasure is buried...
-Stick to the point.

39:42.110 --> 39:42.930
And then what?

39:45.150 --> 39:46.400
And then... Well...

39:47.920 --> 39:48.840
The crowdfunded tomb-robbing scheme

39:48.840 --> 39:49.770
got discovered.

39:50.920 --> 39:52.960
The two of them killed someone over it

39:52.960 --> 39:54.820
and e-ended up on the wanted list.

39:55.760 --> 39:57.490
So Dong fled to Southeast Asia.

39:57.840 --> 39:58.760
That's when we

39:58.760 --> 39:59.960
went our separate ways.

39:59.960 --> 40:02.160
Mei Dong has a murder charge on him, huh?

40:02.840 --> 40:04.970
So what was he doing in Southeast Asia?

40:06.280 --> 40:07.610
Started a new business.

40:08.230 --> 40:09.490
What kind of business?

40:11.440 --> 40:12.840
Financial derivatives.

40:15.030 --> 40:16.460
Just l-loan sharking.

40:17.710 --> 40:19.710
He provided capital from overseas,

40:20.110 --> 40:21.550
while Lin Kai and I handled

40:21.550 --> 40:23.030
debt collection and lending here.

40:23.030 --> 40:24.160
Just loan sharking?

40:24.880 --> 40:26.280
A-And money laundering.

40:29.460 --> 40:30.660
Tell us about Liu Bei.

40:32.700 --> 40:34.720
I-I really don't know about him.

40:35.510 --> 40:36.630
We haven't been in touch for a long time.

40:36.630 --> 40:38.320
I-I just heard that he...

40:38.360 --> 40:40.320
he might still be doing his old trade.

40:40.320 --> 40:41.750
Besides tomb raiding,

40:41.960 --> 40:43.070
has Liu Bei been

40:43.110 --> 40:45.170
negotiating some big deal recently?

40:45.550 --> 40:46.970
About...

40:47.190 --> 40:48.250
some big artifact?

40:50.550 --> 40:51.220
Well...

40:52.110 --> 40:53.860
I really... really...

40:53.880 --> 40:54.940
really don't know.

40:56.630 --> 40:58.090
Mei Dong is back, you know?

41:01.190 --> 41:02.060
Impossible.

41:02.800 --> 41:03.920
Absolutely impossible.

41:03.920 --> 41:05.470
He's a wanted criminal.

41:05.590 --> 41:07.190
He wouldn't dare come back
even if his own mother died.

41:07.190 --> 41:08.790
Doesn't he value your bonds?

41:08.880 --> 41:10.890
Your good buddy Lin Kai died.

41:11.070 --> 41:12.800
Wouldn't he come back for that?

41:13.800 --> 41:14.930
He is a loyal friend.

41:16.180 --> 41:18.310
There's real brotherhood between us.

41:19.630 --> 41:20.560
I'm telling you,

41:21.020 --> 41:22.080
Mei Dong is back.

41:24.150 --> 41:25.440
Help me get him to come out.

41:25.440 --> 41:27.100
That's impossible.

41:27.670 --> 41:28.360
No, officer.

41:28.360 --> 41:30.230
I-It's not that I don't want to help you.

41:30.230 --> 41:32.290
H-He really wouldn't dare come back.

41:32.360 --> 41:32.960
He...

41:35.870 --> 41:36.580
[Dong]

41:37.510 --> 41:38.650
It's M-Mei Dong.

41:41.150 --> 41:42.990
[Dong]

41:47.400 --> 41:48.730
You know what to say, eh?

41:50.810 --> 41:51.930
Don't stutter.

41:54.500 --> 41:57.870
[Dong]

41:59.760 --> 42:00.680
D-Dong.

42:00.710 --> 42:01.420
Wei,

42:01.670 --> 42:03.070
I'm back in Sanjiangkou.

42:03.190 --> 42:04.590
Do you have time tonight?

42:05.920 --> 42:06.900
I-I do.

42:08.360 --> 42:09.560
Why did you come back?

42:10.550 --> 42:11.320
W-W-Why did you

42:11.320 --> 42:12.840
come back so suddenly?

42:13.230 --> 42:15.070
There's a big deal in Sanjiangkou.

42:15.070 --> 42:16.880
I came back to negotiate personally.

42:16.880 --> 42:17.710
If it goes through,

42:17.710 --> 42:20.170
we won't need to work
for three to five years.

42:20.670 --> 42:22.050
Then let's say 7 PM,

42:22.320 --> 42:23.440
in the Guanlan Hotel lobby.

42:23.440 --> 42:24.440
I'll wait for you.

42:25.920 --> 42:26.360
You...

42:27.880 --> 42:28.480
Didn't you say

42:28.480 --> 42:31.010
he wouldn't come back
even if his mother died?

42:32.190 --> 42:34.120
You haven't been straight with us.

42:35.140 --> 42:37.340
[Investigation Area]

42:40.600 --> 42:49.200
[Investigation Area]

42:46.150 --> 42:46.630
Chief,

42:47.110 --> 42:48.760
what does catching Mei Dong
have to do with

42:48.760 --> 42:50.590
us investigating Zhou Rong and his men?

42:50.590 --> 42:52.120
It has nothing to do with it.

42:52.230 --> 42:52.920
If it doesn't,

42:52.920 --> 42:54.520
why are we catching Mei Dong?

42:55.400 --> 42:57.530
Mei Dong has a big deal to negotiate.

42:57.820 --> 42:59.110
Liu Bei has a big business to conduct.

42:59.110 --> 43:00.910
And they both end up in this city.

43:01.110 --> 43:02.420
I have a feeling there's something bigger

43:02.420 --> 43:03.450
going on here.

43:04.320 --> 43:05.050
Chief Zhang.

43:06.110 --> 43:07.110
Lin Kai's time of death

43:07.110 --> 43:08.510
was within the last 72 hours.

43:08.510 --> 43:09.510
It must have been those two kidnappers

43:09.510 --> 43:10.230
returning.

43:10.360 --> 43:11.670
Report it to Director Gao.

43:11.670 --> 43:13.150
It should satisfy him, right?

43:13.150 --> 43:14.770
I-I also have some news.

43:14.920 --> 43:15.880
Mei Dong called.

43:16.880 --> 43:17.400
He's arranged to meet Yang Wei

43:17.400 --> 43:18.370
tonight at 7 PM

43:18.510 --> 43:19.820
at the Guanlan Hotel.

43:20.280 --> 43:21.330
It really was him.

43:22.000 --> 43:22.710
What is he doing back here?

43:22.710 --> 43:23.550
Trying to get himself caught?

43:23.550 --> 43:26.030
Mei Dong said he came back
to negotiate a deal.

43:26.030 --> 43:26.920
After all his years

43:26.920 --> 43:28.840
laundering money in Southeast Asia,

43:28.840 --> 43:30.560
for him to show up in person,

43:30.760 --> 43:32.360
the amount must be enormous.

43:33.230 --> 43:34.710
They think they can come and go

43:34.710 --> 43:35.630
whenever they want?

43:35.630 --> 43:36.360
Not a chance.

43:36.880 --> 43:37.810
In their dreams.

43:37.880 --> 43:38.510
Then, let's move quickly

43:38.510 --> 43:39.590
and arrange an arrest.

43:39.590 --> 43:39.960
Okay.

43:44.840 --> 43:46.570
Sit out the operation tonight.

43:47.360 --> 43:48.510
I have an even more important task

43:48.510 --> 43:49.210
for you.

43:50.030 --> 43:51.370
Organize the materials

43:51.440 --> 43:53.030
for the provincial task force first,

43:53.030 --> 43:54.530
and send them to Director Gao.

43:54.530 --> 43:55.280
There's one thing

43:55.280 --> 43:56.590
that needs to be made absolutely clear:

43:56.590 --> 43:58.590
request that jurisdiction
be formally assigned to us

43:58.590 --> 44:00.450
so we can lead the investigation.

44:00.800 --> 44:01.530
We will report

44:01.530 --> 44:02.670
all developments in real time

44:02.670 --> 44:05.230
and hand over the suspects
according to regulations afterward.

44:05.230 --> 44:06.430
Be clear about it,

44:06.670 --> 44:08.190
but keep the wording tactful.

44:08.190 --> 44:09.800
After all, they're from
the Provincial Department.

44:09.800 --> 44:11.320
Organizing materials again?

44:11.320 --> 44:12.690
I'm fully recovered.

44:12.840 --> 44:14.550
I know you're fully recovered.

44:14.550 --> 44:16.350
But can I trust others to do this?

44:16.710 --> 44:17.440
Wang Ruijun?

44:17.550 --> 44:18.150
Song Xing?

44:21.840 --> 44:22.760
Understood. Consider it done.
